<title>USA: Republic, FFO Financial in merger talks.</title>
<headline>Republic, FFO Financial in merger talks.</headline>
<dateline>ST. CLOUD, Fla. 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>F.F.O. Financial Group Inc said on Thursday it was engaged in talks with Republic Bancshares Inc about a possible combination of the two companies.</p>
<p>The company said there could be no assurances a definitive agreement would be reached, and any deal would be subjet to shareholder and board approval.</p>
</text>
